WEBVTT

00:01:38.260 --> 00:01:43.280
Takao and the rest of the BBA Team fell into Team Psykick's underhanded trap

00:01:43.280 --> 00:01:46.400
and was held hostage on a remote island.

00:01:50.960 --> 00:01:51.980
Come on!

00:01:51.980 --> 00:01:54.980
Seiryu!!

00:02:23.820 --> 00:02:30.280
Team Psykick had a close battle with the BBA team while trying to take their Sacred Beasts.

00:02:30.280 --> 00:02:32.710
I refuse to lose!

00:02:33.580 --> 00:02:38.530
In the end, Takao overpowers his leg injury to win,

00:02:38.530 --> 00:02:42.600
And finally, Chairman Daitenji came to our rescue.

00:02:52.680 --> 00:02:56.100
About a week has passed since then.

00:03:02.770 --> 00:03:04.080
Pretty good!

00:03:04.080 --> 00:03:05.950
You ain't bad, kid!

00:03:06.860 --> 00:03:10.170
Thank you for your support!

00:03:10.170 --> 00:03:11.950
What do you think you're doing?

00:03:11.950 --> 00:03:13.040
Oh crap!

00:03:14.560 --> 00:03:16.910
I turn away for a second
and you're up to this!

00:03:16.910 --> 00:03:18.530
This is a hospital!

00:03:18.530 --> 00:03:20.090
Yes sir...

00:03:21.420 --> 00:03:22.380
Takao!

00:03:23.860 --> 00:03:26.780
Max, don't scare me like that!

00:03:26.780 --> 00:03:28.820
I thought you were a real doctor there.

00:03:28.820 --> 00:03:30.870
You look like you're recovering well.

00:03:31.510 --> 00:03:32.880
Rei! Kai!

00:03:32.880 --> 00:03:36.370
We didn't even need to come see you.

00:03:36.370 --> 00:03:39.600
Yeah. I'm all good now, as you can see!

00:03:40.000 --> 00:03:43.100
If you're healed, why don't you just check out?

00:03:43.100 --> 00:03:47.010
It's not like you to stay in here
where there's peace and quiet.

00:03:47.010 --> 00:03:49.660
You poor saps just don't get it!

00:03:49.870 --> 00:03:52.650
I don't have to go to school,

00:03:52.650 --> 00:03:55.460
there's no homework, and I
can read all the comics I want.

00:03:55.460 --> 00:03:58.210
And all the nurses are so nice!

00:03:59.860 --> 00:04:01.570
It's the best!

00:04:01.570 --> 00:04:02.850
Amazing...

00:04:02.850 --> 00:04:05.050
Do you really want to
slack off that badly?

00:04:05.050 --> 00:04:07.570
So much so that I can't stand it!

00:04:07.570 --> 00:04:09.550
Don't let Hiromi find out!

00:04:12.210 --> 00:04:13.710
Takao!

00:04:14.860 --> 00:04:17.920
Are you better yet?
With all that jumping around...

00:04:18.560 --> 00:04:20.710
I wasn't jumping around!

00:04:20.900 --> 00:04:23.690
You need to focus on healing.

00:04:23.690 --> 00:04:27.200
Even Ms. Keiko came because
she was so worried about you!

00:04:33.010 --> 00:04:35.440
How are you feeling, Mr. Kinomiya?

00:04:38.480 --> 00:04:40.390
You poor thing...

00:04:40.390 --> 00:04:43.600
You can't come to school if
you feel that bad, I suppose.

00:04:43.600 --> 00:04:45.520
How long do you think it'll be?

00:04:45.520 --> 00:04:49.310
Maybe 10 days... or up to a month...

00:04:49.310 --> 00:04:51.930
Maybe even three months...

00:04:53.100 --> 00:04:56.200
I bet you're so lonely since you can't see all your friends at school.

00:04:56.200 --> 00:05:00.530
Hang in there... I'll be
praying for you to heal soon.

00:05:02.280 --> 00:05:04.660
This is for you, Mr. Kinomiya.

00:05:05.020 --> 00:05:07.200
Aww, thanks, Ms. Keiko!

00:05:07.200 --> 00:05:09.440
I wasn't expecting to get anything!

00:05:09.440 --> 00:05:12.120
Let's open this sucker up!

00:05:12.120 --> 00:05:15.930
Hey! Max, Rei, Kai!
Let's all eat it together!

00:05:17.050 --> 00:05:19.170
Is it cake? Is it pudding?

00:05:19.170 --> 00:05:21.410
Time to dig in!

00:05:23.280 --> 00:05:24.610
What is this?

00:05:24.840 --> 00:05:28.960
It'd be bad if you got
behind in classes, dummy!

00:05:28.960 --> 00:05:32.690
So she brought you
worksheets and textbooks!

00:05:32.690 --> 00:05:34.420
Great...

00:05:35.020 --> 00:05:37.480
Brainfood is healthier than a cake!

00:05:37.480 --> 00:05:39.250
Too bad for you.

00:05:40.190 --> 00:05:43.210
Should I have bought him a cake?

00:05:43.560 --> 00:05:46.650
Mr. Kinomiya, how are you feeling?

00:05:46.650 --> 00:05:48.180
Chairman Daitenji.

00:05:53.600 --> 00:05:57.380
I'm deeply sorry for what
happened on the island.

00:05:57.380 --> 00:06:00.660
I've caused a lot of
trouble for you all.

00:06:00.660 --> 00:06:02.350
It's fine.

00:06:02.710 --> 00:06:04.820
It isn't your fault.

00:06:04.820 --> 00:06:07.250
It's all Team Psykick!

00:06:07.250 --> 00:06:09.840
Yeah. Those mad scientists are bad news.

00:06:09.840 --> 00:06:13.930
But I was the one who let
you all into such danger.

00:06:13.930 --> 00:06:17.170
On a side note, I've got a favor.

00:06:17.170 --> 00:06:19.600
There's someone I want to find.

00:06:19.600 --> 00:06:21.240
Who would that be?

00:06:21.240 --> 00:06:22.810
This guy named Ozma.

00:06:23.050 --> 00:06:24.180
Ozma?

00:06:25.100 --> 00:06:28.050
Is that the boy you fought before?

00:06:28.050 --> 00:06:32.480
Yeah. I can't sit still until
I get my revenge on him.

00:06:32.480 --> 00:06:34.500
Me too!

00:06:34.500 --> 00:06:37.620
I want to find the girl
who beat me in New York

00:06:37.620 --> 00:06:39.610
and battle her again!

00:06:39.860 --> 00:06:42.680
You mean the Bladers with
the invisible Sacred Beasts?

00:06:42.680 --> 00:06:44.680
Invisible Sacred Beasts?

00:06:45.350 --> 00:06:48.670
If I had realized they used
an invisible Sacred Beast,

00:06:48.670 --> 00:06:52.070
then I would have fought
it with Genbu! Shoot!

00:06:52.070 --> 00:06:54.350
The same goes for us.

00:06:54.690 --> 00:06:56.020
Right, Kai?

00:06:58.380 --> 00:06:59.500
What's up?

00:06:59.500 --> 00:07:01.600
Someone's watching us.

00:07:02.020 --> 00:07:03.760
Or maybe it was my imagination.

00:07:06.580 --> 00:07:11.970
So we were all beaten by Bladers
with invisible Sacred Beasts.

00:07:11.970 --> 00:07:13.690
We all feel the same.

00:07:13.690 --> 00:07:15.850
I don't.

00:07:16.720 --> 00:07:18.990
Oh right. You tied.

00:07:19.620 --> 00:07:21.890
And we'll finish things one day.

00:07:21.890 --> 00:07:23.530
I understand.

00:07:23.530 --> 00:07:28.590
I will search for them using BBA
branches all over the world.

00:07:28.590 --> 00:07:31.120
Really? I knew it was right to ask you!

00:07:31.340 --> 00:07:34.130
It's the least I can do.

00:07:34.130 --> 00:07:38.550
This is all the data I have
on Ozma and his team.

00:07:38.770 --> 00:07:44.440
Thank you. Well then, Kinomiya,
I do hope you recover soon.

00:07:44.440 --> 00:07:46.050
Y-yes.

00:07:46.350 --> 00:07:49.120
I still wanna take things easy...

00:08:02.000 --> 00:08:03.570
This is it, bro!

00:08:05.050 --> 00:08:07.070
Blast you, Takao Kinomiya...

00:08:07.070 --> 00:08:10.120
How long are you going
to obsess over that?

00:08:10.120 --> 00:08:11.040
Mr. Gideon!

00:08:11.040 --> 00:08:13.840
You couldn't take
the four Sacred Beasts.

00:08:13.840 --> 00:08:17.780
You should be a good sport
and admit defeat, Doctor.

00:08:18.600 --> 00:08:21.410
I promise I will, next time.

00:08:21.410 --> 00:08:26.050
There's no need for a next time.
Repeating the same mistakes over and over

00:08:26.050 --> 00:08:29.340
will just provide more
unfortunate results.

00:08:29.910 --> 00:08:33.280
Do you mean we should
change our capture methods?

00:08:33.280 --> 00:08:37.580
If we want to capture a Sacred Beast, it's
most important that we have one ourselves.

00:08:37.580 --> 00:08:40.610
Capture a Sacred Beast
with one of our own...

00:08:40.610 --> 00:08:43.560
I don't quite understand, Mr. Gideon.

00:08:43.860 --> 00:08:50.030
Did you forget about the vast amount of data we have from our previous plans?

00:08:50.340 --> 00:08:53.920
If you give form to the
data we've collected,

00:08:53.920 --> 00:08:56.820
it's as good as having
a Sacred Beast itself.

00:08:56.820 --> 00:08:59.790
So we should make one ourselves?

00:08:59.790 --> 00:09:01.540
Make a Sacred Beast...?

00:09:01.540 --> 00:09:03.280
Can we really...?

00:09:03.470 --> 00:09:05.850
No, it's not impossible...

00:09:06.160 --> 00:09:09.190
If the data we input
into it is perfected,

00:09:09.190 --> 00:09:14.770
then the same methods we used to produce
the robo-shooter and Beys should do the trick.

00:09:14.770 --> 00:09:16.120
However...

00:09:16.870 --> 00:09:20.740
You don't have time
to mull over it, Doctor.

00:09:22.340 --> 00:09:26.530
Begin the development of the
digital Sacred Beasts ASAP!

00:09:26.530 --> 00:09:27.800
Yes, sir!

00:09:28.450 --> 00:09:30.270
A digital Sacred Beast...

00:09:48.500 --> 00:09:49.960
Go, Shoot!

00:09:51.200 --> 00:09:54.000
Show me what you've
got, Flash Leopard!

00:09:58.360 --> 00:10:00.320
That's it. Good.

00:10:05.140 --> 00:10:06.590
A new model?

00:10:06.590 --> 00:10:09.420
Yeah. Its movements have
sped up considerably.

00:10:14.970 --> 00:10:15.990
What's this?

00:10:18.740 --> 00:10:19.990
Ozma!

00:10:19.990 --> 00:10:20.710
Mariam!

00:10:20.710 --> 00:10:23.040
I hope you haven't
forgotten about me, too!

00:10:23.040 --> 00:10:23.940
Yusuf!

00:10:25.460 --> 00:10:27.360
You two are early.

00:10:27.360 --> 00:10:28.910
No we're not.

00:10:28.910 --> 00:10:34.500
I was going to come after beating Rei
Kon in China, but things got complicated.

00:10:34.740 --> 00:10:37.510
Not that I really care,
but this place is filthy.

00:10:37.510 --> 00:10:41.320
If you're gonna bitch about it, then find your own place, Mariam.

00:10:41.740 --> 00:10:45.140
I will. Last thing I want is to be
huddled up with you in a tiny place like this.

00:10:45.140 --> 00:10:45.950
What?!

00:10:45.950 --> 00:10:47.550
Come on, come on.

00:10:48.320 --> 00:10:52.890
By the way Ozma, did you get the BBA team's Sacred Beasts yet?

00:10:52.890 --> 00:10:56.000
No. I'm waiting for the right opportunity.

00:10:56.000 --> 00:10:59.400
You haven't? What are you
sitting around for then?

00:10:59.400 --> 00:11:00.450
Yusuf!

00:11:00.930 --> 00:11:03.240
Watch your mouth.

00:11:04.310 --> 00:11:06.530
We got food! I'll take one!

00:11:07.520 --> 00:11:12.890
I heard those scientists on the island almost beat you guys to the punch.

00:11:13.810 --> 00:11:18.600
The scientists will never be able to
take the four Sacred Beasts anyway.

00:11:18.890 --> 00:11:21.940
The Sacred Beasts haven't
even begun to grow yet.

00:11:21.940 --> 00:11:25.480
But take one wrong move
and they're gone for good.

00:11:25.480 --> 00:11:31.700
I don't think the scientists know how
much their Sacred Beasts have grown.

00:11:32.080 --> 00:11:35.110
You should have some too, Yusuf!
They taste awful though.

00:11:35.110 --> 00:11:36.490
All yours, Sis.

00:11:36.490 --> 00:11:37.620
If you say so!

00:11:39.510 --> 00:11:41.360
So basically...

00:11:42.080 --> 00:11:47.080
We need to protect the Sacred
Beasts from those pesky scientists.

00:11:47.080 --> 00:11:48.200
Exactly.

00:11:48.480 --> 00:11:50.200
No thanks.

00:11:50.200 --> 00:11:51.110
Dunga?

00:11:51.110 --> 00:11:53.620
I ain't just gonna sit
on my ass and wait!

00:11:53.950 --> 00:11:57.980
We need to get in there and finish the job before they get in our away again!

00:11:57.980 --> 00:11:59.320
You're so simple.

00:11:59.320 --> 00:12:00.280
What'd you say?

00:12:00.280 --> 00:12:03.290
Yusuf's right. Calm down, Dunga.

00:12:04.700 --> 00:12:08.370
This blockhead won't get it through his thick skull, no matter what you say.

00:12:08.370 --> 00:12:09.940
Mariam, you little--

00:12:09.940 --> 00:12:18.660
Just for the record, Ozma, Yusuf, and I all
beat the pants off of the BBA team in battle.

00:12:18.970 --> 00:12:21.980
And how did you do?

00:12:22.210 --> 00:12:23.930
You're crossing the line, Sis.

00:12:23.930 --> 00:12:27.350
Hmm... Did you beat Kai Hiwatari?

00:12:27.460 --> 00:12:29.300
So how'd it go, Dunga?

00:12:29.300 --> 00:12:31.360
So? So?

00:12:35.790 --> 00:12:41.510
Watch an' learn! I'm gonna go beat the tar out of Kai Hiwatari and Dranzer right now!

00:12:41.510 --> 00:12:42.490
Dunga!

00:12:44.490 --> 00:12:47.100
Goddammit! I'm coming
for you, Kai Hiwatari!

00:12:48.000 --> 00:12:52.070
I have no idea what goes
through that blockhead's mind.

00:12:52.070 --> 00:12:54.250
Should we let him go, Ozma?

00:12:57.960 --> 00:13:07.930
"Bakuten Shoot Beyblade 2002"

00:13:13.600 --> 00:13:16.550
Our work is advancing smoothly.

00:13:16.550 --> 00:13:22.000
We're pouring all of our previous research and
techniques into this digital Sacred Beast project.

00:13:22.580 --> 00:13:24.640
Failure is not an option.

00:13:25.180 --> 00:13:26.050
Doctor.

00:13:26.450 --> 00:13:27.380
What?

00:13:27.620 --> 00:13:31.060
As you can see, this is a record of all the accumulated data for each target.

00:13:31.520 --> 00:13:34.870
Target D is extremely lacking in data.

00:13:35.450 --> 00:13:37.330
Him, then?

00:13:42.750 --> 00:13:45.090
Kai Hiwatari.

00:13:45.260 --> 00:13:49.840
Our devices were destroyed before he summoned his Sacred Beast,

00:13:49.840 --> 00:13:51.980
So he's the only one we lack data on.

00:13:52.400 --> 00:13:53.650
Fool!

00:13:53.940 --> 00:13:58.540
Do you think we can make the ultimate digital Sacred Beast without all four members' data?!

00:13:58.540 --> 00:13:59.460
No, sir!

00:13:59.460 --> 00:14:00.370
You!

00:14:00.560 --> 00:14:03.810
We will find a means to
obtain his data immediately!

00:14:12.090 --> 00:14:15.560
It feels so good to be back.

00:14:15.560 --> 00:14:17.870
You're such a drama queen.

00:14:17.870 --> 00:14:22.370
But I haven't been back since we got on the bus and got taken to that island.

00:14:22.810 --> 00:14:26.000
Grandpa! Takao is home!

00:14:28.140 --> 00:14:30.640
Takao! I'm glad you're safe!

00:14:31.390 --> 00:14:34.170
Sorry to worry you, Grandpa.

00:14:34.170 --> 00:14:37.140
As you can see, I'm as good as new!

00:14:37.140 --> 00:14:39.610
Don't push yourself!

00:14:39.810 --> 00:14:42.510
You're finally home, eh Takao?

00:14:43.110 --> 00:14:44.230
Max!

00:14:44.230 --> 00:14:48.640
Is that a new Shooter?
Where'd you get it?

00:14:48.640 --> 00:14:53.540
Chairman Daitenji gave them to us to
celebrate your release from the hospital.

00:14:53.680 --> 00:14:56.140
This is your Shooter.

00:14:57.740 --> 00:15:00.550
He's got better taste
than I give him credit for!

00:15:00.980 --> 00:15:03.400
We all got one.

00:15:03.400 --> 00:15:06.480
I tried it earlier, and it's pretty great.

00:15:06.480 --> 00:15:07.610
Oh really?

00:15:07.610 --> 00:15:11.520
Alright, I'm gonna go
wild for once in a while!

00:15:11.520 --> 00:15:12.750
Stop!

00:15:13.170 --> 00:15:16.450
You and Dragoon went plenty
wild in the hospital, right?

00:15:17.200 --> 00:15:18.490
You knew?

00:15:18.490 --> 00:15:20.610
The nurses told me.

00:15:20.610 --> 00:15:26.190
And school's tomorrow, but you haven't
done a single page of homework, have you?

00:15:26.980 --> 00:15:30.480
I'll hold on to this until you finish.

00:15:30.480 --> 00:15:31.310
Oh, come on--

00:15:31.310 --> 00:15:32.770
Fool!

00:15:33.010 --> 00:15:37.840
Anyone ungrateful of Hiromi's
advice has to deal with me!

00:15:39.010 --> 00:15:40.750
Fine, I get it!

00:15:41.610 --> 00:15:44.480
I knew I should've
stayed in the hospital...

00:15:51.360 --> 00:15:52.980
I remember you!

00:15:53.430 --> 00:16:00.950
Kai!

00:16:00.950 --> 00:16:03.010
Get back here!

00:16:11.130 --> 00:16:12.330
Get out here!

00:16:13.570 --> 00:16:16.370
I've been itching to
see you, Kai Hiwatari.

00:16:16.680 --> 00:16:18.910
Who the hell do
you think you are?

00:16:18.910 --> 00:16:20.230
The name's Dunga.

00:16:20.230 --> 00:16:24.030
Let's battle, Kai!
And finish what we started!

00:16:24.120 --> 00:16:25.640
My pleasure.

00:16:28.210 --> 00:16:30.760
We lucked out.

00:16:30.900 --> 00:16:34.820
All because he tailed Kai all morning, Bro!

00:16:35.190 --> 00:16:38.130
We're too far away.
Put us right above them.

00:16:38.130 --> 00:16:39.410
You got it!

00:16:44.910 --> 00:16:49.610
Doctor, we'll be broadcasting
the footage through channel 2.

00:16:55.520 --> 00:16:58.220
Let's do it. Go, Shoot!

00:17:03.810 --> 00:17:05.940
You won't be able to keep up!

00:17:09.760 --> 00:17:10.670
What?!

00:17:11.330 --> 00:17:12.930
Your tricks won't work on me.

00:17:13.470 --> 00:17:15.810
Let go of me already, Hiromi!

00:17:15.810 --> 00:17:19.330
And that's how you thank me for
being worried about your studies?!

00:17:19.330 --> 00:17:20.560
Don't be so rude!

00:17:20.560 --> 00:17:21.460
It's Kai!

00:17:22.130 --> 00:17:23.980
Who's he battling?

00:17:23.980 --> 00:17:25.060
Takao!

00:17:25.060 --> 00:17:26.400
Kai!

00:17:26.720 --> 00:17:27.910
Get back!

00:17:28.670 --> 00:17:30.000
Stay out of this.

00:17:30.000 --> 00:17:31.780
Dunga is my opponent!

00:17:32.580 --> 00:17:33.630
Kai...

00:17:37.840 --> 00:17:40.700
I will defeat him myself!

00:17:42.130 --> 00:17:43.730
I get it. This guy is...

00:17:43.730 --> 00:17:46.940
a Blader with an invisible
Sacred Beast that Kai fought!

00:17:47.120 --> 00:17:48.790
Come on, Dunga!

00:17:48.790 --> 00:17:51.490
I'm gonna finish you off
right here and now, Kai!

00:17:54.230 --> 00:17:56.820
Go, Dranzer!!

00:17:58.660 --> 00:18:01.490
Sacred Beast readout
is increasing rapidly!

00:18:01.490 --> 00:18:05.020
Kai Hiwatari, summon your Sacred Beast!

00:18:05.840 --> 00:18:08.380
Error detected in the equipment!
We lost the signal!

00:18:09.290 --> 00:18:10.230
No!

00:18:10.580 --> 00:18:13.040
Get the sensor closer in!

00:18:13.270 --> 00:18:16.170
Hurry it up! Once the Sacred
Beast is out it'll be too late!

00:18:16.170 --> 00:18:17.010
Sir.

00:18:17.540 --> 00:18:19.460
Move the sensor in closer.

00:18:19.460 --> 00:18:20.830
Aye aye, sir!

00:18:23.500 --> 00:18:25.160
Good. All clear.

00:18:25.160 --> 00:18:26.030
What?!

00:18:28.850 --> 00:18:31.460
There's the invisible Sacred Beast!

00:18:39.250 --> 00:18:40.190
Kai!

00:18:41.570 --> 00:18:44.040
Bring it on, Kai!

00:18:44.320 --> 00:18:47.440
Go, Dranzer!!

00:18:53.480 --> 00:18:54.610
Suzaku...

00:18:55.350 --> 00:18:57.870
Suzaku, take him down!

00:19:01.730 --> 00:19:02.980
Here it is.

00:19:11.650 --> 00:19:14.530
Is it fighting that invisible enemy?

00:19:23.850 --> 00:19:26.110
There are some intense
electromagnetic waves nearby...

00:19:27.160 --> 00:19:29.180
It's them! Psykick!

00:19:29.180 --> 00:19:29.990
What?!

00:19:32.330 --> 00:19:33.210
What the hell?

00:19:34.190 --> 00:19:35.680
What is this?

00:19:36.170 --> 00:19:37.710
B-Bro!

00:19:38.030 --> 00:19:40.310
Damn! Pull back the arm sensor!

00:19:40.850 --> 00:19:43.090
Hurry up, it's gonna blow!

00:19:50.420 --> 00:19:51.940
Kai, watch out!

00:20:17.650 --> 00:20:18.990
Are you okay, Hiromi?

00:20:19.480 --> 00:20:20.800
Yeah, thankfully.

00:20:22.410 --> 00:20:23.830
Dunga!

00:20:23.830 --> 00:20:24.930
Not again!

00:20:25.480 --> 00:20:26.420
Kai...!

00:20:46.580 --> 00:20:47.570
Damn...

00:20:47.820 --> 00:20:49.940
Don't overdo it, Dunga.

00:20:49.940 --> 00:20:52.330
You're a blockhead with a short fuse.

00:20:52.850 --> 00:20:57.000
I was so close to
shutting Kai down for good.

00:20:57.200 --> 00:21:00.900
Darn it! If those scientists
hadn't butted in...

00:21:02.850 --> 00:21:04.450
Those scientists again...

00:21:05.540 --> 00:21:08.500
What do you think you're doing?
Now we have no data on Kai!

00:21:08.500 --> 00:21:09.810
The data is safe and sound.

00:21:09.810 --> 00:21:10.980
It is?

00:21:11.410 --> 00:21:13.490
The direct transfer may have failed,

00:21:13.490 --> 00:21:18.090
but we've got it
backed up on this disk!

00:21:18.280 --> 00:21:19.700
I see.

00:21:19.700 --> 00:21:22.290
Get it back here ASAP.

00:21:22.290 --> 00:21:23.410
Affirmative.

00:21:24.250 --> 00:21:28.000
Now we have data on
the four Sacred Beasts.

00:21:28.260 --> 00:21:32.010
And now we just have to breathe life into the digital Sacred Beasts.

00:22:59.500 --> 00:23:02.910
Team Psykick hasn't given up yet.

00:23:03.040 --> 00:23:05.410
Their next plan is to make
a digital Sacred Beast.

00:23:05.410 --> 00:23:08.860
I wonder if digital Sacred
Beasts taste good?

00:23:08.860 --> 00:23:10.740
A Sacred Beast with a
side of computer chips?

00:23:11.250 --> 00:23:13.960
"This isn't the time to
be talking nonsense"?!

00:23:13.960 --> 00:23:15.770
You're so serious, Chairman!

00:23:15.770 --> 00:23:18.560
Anyway, Max and Rei are
in big trouble next week!

00:23:18.560 --> 00:23:20.340
You won't want to miss it!
